@startuml
title Approval workflow lifecycle
[*] --> AwaitingDecision
AwaitingDecision --> AwaitingDecision : approve, levels remain
AwaitingDecision --> Approved : final required approval
AwaitingDecision --> Rejected : any rejection
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
note right: Duplicate, late, ineligible, and self decisions are rejected.
@enduml
